'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an area added in Stardew Valley Expanded (SVE) that you need to pass in order to get to the [[Stardew:Witch's Swamp|Witch's Swamp]]. The teleport to the Witch's Swamp is located at the top northeast corner of the area. 
It is accessible from both the warp located in the cave northeast of the [[Stardew:Railroad|Railroad]] and the warp in front of the Witch's Hut.

