==Henchman's Backyard==
The Henchman's Backyard is found in the Forbidden Maze behind the [[Henchman's House]], and becomes available after the [[Henchman|Henchman's]] 8 Heart Event.

The area contains five shrines. There are three toggleable shrines similar to those in the [[Stardew:Witch's Hut|Witch's Hut]], and two shrines where materials can be traded for rare items. 
